[{"sha": "e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3", "node_id": "C_kwDOB5aMANoAKGU2ODAzOTE1Nzk2YmFlM2EzN2NmODM2ZGYxYWJiMzE0NDBmYjhjZDM", "commit": {"author": {"name": "KR Ravindra", "email": "rajaravindra919@gmail.com", "date": "2026-10-01T21:39:49Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-10-01T21:39:49Z"}, "message": "Account for cached messages size in bagfile split-by-size decision (#2496)\n\nWhen recording with the writer cache enabled (max_cache_size > 0),\nshould_split_bagfile() compared only the storage's bagfile size against\nmax_bagfile_size. Messages still residing in the cache are flushed to\nthe current bagfile on split, so files could exceed the limit by up to\nthe cache size.\n\nAdd MessageCacheInterface::get_current_size() (default 0), implement it\nin MessageCache as the byte size of the producer buffer, and add it to\nthe storage size in the split-by-size decision.\n\nFixes https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/issues/2310\n\nSigned-off-by: KR Ravindra <42912207+KR-Ravindra@users.noreply.github.com>", "tree": {"sha": "ddd91adce0f9d6d924c486814ec40090e22677f2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/trees/ddd91adce0f9d6d924c486814ec40090e22677f2"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/commits/e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvtMlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS5gQAHELyNZRHMJkOfM2gJ4lT+YU\n1Ua6TOF/0eA0CQENmm4qewQC/AF9K/y1FXUiekcaMTHkz1A2pq5TaTeQEfaqn7Qt\njueKIAqZQW5teYYwzru6MKTuadY3L4fIzS+74h+/4xdzdyZagOZJPT9EWXZlcgN7\n3NIQfV2dN+rPX3flAuJZa6athc8pfrQ7Ut6FasAX+j0CYhg1L/Y+tZSE9LVNgmCV\nc47GV8+CmUivVziV0ZIx76NXrYD3hJFExcr4sD+B+4JN8LGsExd1i0yF/4Kk5YdT\n/H7h/nu8ntAy2+krWgPOgFBVvHmQdGMrfLd4nmD/iP2ReJFKJdyTvhHQIo1JWkRS\nyN+nLcGOQeOJzh/psp8MFlMMBXsoN3sq5u6f8NjtYfVYrxl5Wic+gcMPmNrpwKdl\n9nwPScM7nSHRAvNKjM1iCJ1g1FVrllt6rtRADsYT84TE2W9jMUsjS7JihyHYrjzE\ngJIvR+/1twlauWtAiq2RNzsLu342ijO1+2d+1Vm/M8AxhUF7GFPyKO9DN+JlzaAy\nBBBG9GIA2gwZyZI0rR5YazZYGuQ7XkuBE9vBRYds9RAbj/maQMGRgCqP7qOa1yjF\n7iONP1dqHUNGNdQgPVj66YpF4s7qZmBthK3KzY45nZidmUjyFTt1Y/jXkJugz7Ri\nhkp/AYKVzyPNYnQR4hvo\n=Jxb4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree ddd91adce0f9d6d924c486814ec40090e22677f2\nparent b3a42339376e8cae82e292081b2378a800152905\nauthor KR Ravindra <rajaravindra919@gmail.com> 1790890789 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790890789 +0200\n\nAccount for cached messages size in bagfile split-by-size decision (#2496)\n\nWhen recording with the writer cache enabled (max_cache_size > 0),\nshould_split_bagfile() compared only the storage's bagfile size against\nmax_bagfile_size. Messages still residing in the cache are flushed to\nthe current bagfile on split, so files could exceed the limit by up to\nthe cache size.\n\nAdd MessageCacheInterface::get_current_size() (default 0), implement it\nin MessageCache as the byte size of the producer buffer, and add it to\nthe storage size in the split-by-size decision.\n\nFixes https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/issues/2310\n\nSigned-off-by: KR Ravindra <42912207+KR-Ravindra@users.noreply.github.com>", "verified_at": "2026-10-01T21:39:49Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3", "html_url": "https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/commit/e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3/comments", "author": {"login": "KR-Ravindra", "id": 42912207, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTEyMjA3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42912207?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KR-Ravindra", "html_url": "https://github.com/KR-Ravindra", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KR-Ravindra/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KR-Ravindra/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.c